# ---- stage E: transport shuttle, Singular ship
item.siliconagevehicles.vehicle.shuttle.name=Transport Shuttle
item.siliconagevehicles.vehicle.ship.name=Singular Ship
sva.tooltip.details.shuttle=A group and cargo - anywhere: free flight in every direction, a sealed cabin with oxygen (under water too), the long-range mode on deuterium. Fly into an open vortex of the core's Ground or Space Bridge - the shuttle comes out on the other side with its people and cargo ("docking").
sva.tooltip.details.ship=The top of the line: flies like the shuttle, only faster, and opens §dits own portal§7 - a Jump to the point of a Coordinator in its cargo or home. The Gravity Anchor holds the ship still, Invisibility hides the crew from hostile mobs. The singularity over the hull pulses.
sva.tooltip.energy.shuttle=Uses: %2$s EU/t in the air (hovering and flying alike - antigravity), %3$s EU/t on the ground. Long-range mode above Y 120 at speed - 0 EU, deuterium 1 mB/s. A full charge lasts ~%4$s blocks.
sva.tooltip.energy.ship=Uses: %2$s EU/t in the air, %3$s EU/t on the ground, 40 EU/t at anchor. Long-range mode above Y 120 at speed - 0 EU, deuterium 1 mB/s. A full charge lasts ~%4$s blocks.
sva.tooltip.vehicle.gas.shuttle=Boost: hydrogen %3$s mB/s, x%4$s speed. Oxygen - the crew breathes it under water (1 mB/s a person). Deuterium - the long-range mode. Helium cools the motor.
sva.tooltip.vehicle.gas.ship=Boost: hydrogen %3$s mB/s, x%4$s speed. Singular matter - the jump (10 mB + 10 per 1000 blocks; another dimension 100) and invisibility (1 mB/s). Argon - the hull field (-40%% damage), oxygen - for the crew, deuterium - the long-range mode, helium - cooling.
sva.tooltip.limits.shuttle=Docking: the bridge's vortex must be open and the bridge open to the pilot (owner, friend or public access). The shuttle pays the pass's mass toll itself (as the bridge does: 1M EU a unit of mass). Someone else's private field on the far side - no. Without charge - a slow descent.
sva.tooltip.limits.ship=Jump: at least 16 blocks; 20M EU + 2M per 1000 blocks (another dimension - 100M), 30 s cooldown. The arrival spot must be free (11x6x11), no foreign private fields. The portal opens for 1.5 s first - the ship stands still.
sva.tooltip.howto.shuttle2=Space - up, Descend (%1$s) or sprint (Ctrl) - down, W/S - forward / back, A/D - turn, Boost (%2$s) - faster. Mode (%3$s) - long-range mode on / off.
sva.tooltip.howto.shuttle3=Seats: 2 pilots and 6 passengers. Charging platform - 7x7 plates. Gases - a cell / bucket or the Gas Column.
sva.tooltip.howto.ship2=Flies like the shuttle. Jump (%5$s) - open the portal to the target, Jump target (%6$s) - the Coordinator in the cargo / home, Anchor (%7$s), Invisibility (%8$s), Mode (%3$s) - long-range mode.
sva.tooltip.howto.ship3=Seats: 2 pilots and 4 passengers. Charging platform - 7x7 plates. Target - a core Coordinator with a point in the cargo; "home" - the pilot's bed (or the world spawn).
