sva.tooltip.road.summary=§7Wheels and tracks: speed +%s%%, wear -%s%%
sva.tooltip.road.marking.2=§fDashed centre line - laid along your look
sva.tooltip.road.marking.4=§fSolid centre line - laid along your look
sva.tooltip.road.marking.6=§fEdge line - on the right of your look
sva.tooltip.road.marking.10=§fArrow - points where you look
sva.tooltip.road.details=The buggy, the crawler and the drill go 30%% faster on asphalt, 20%% on the concrete slab. Wall hits and hard landings on a road wear the hull half as much (a quarter less on concrete). The hoverbike floats over anything, aircraft need a runway.
sva.tooltip.howto.road.0=Crafting table: gravel x4, sand x2, coal or charcoal x3 - 8 asphalt.
sva.tooltip.howto.road.1=Crafting table: stone x4, sand x4, a water bucket (you get the bucket back) - 8 concrete slabs.
sva.tooltip.howto.road.2=Crafting table: asphalt x2 and bone meal - 2 blocks.
sva.tooltip.howto.road.4=Crafting table: asphalt x3 and bone meal - 3 blocks.
sva.tooltip.howto.road.6=Crafting table: asphalt and bone meal - 1 block.
sva.tooltip.howto.road.10=Crafting table: asphalt x4 and bone meal - 4 blocks.
sva.tooltip.curb.summary=§7A half block of concrete along the road
sva.tooltip.curb.details=Wheeled vehicles drive up onto the curb, but it adds no speed - it is not road.
sva.tooltip.howto.curb=Crafting table: 3 concrete slabs in a row - 6 curbs.
sva.tooltip.roadSign.summary=§7A road sign, facing the one who places it
sva.tooltip.roadSign.details=A post with a plate, one block tall. For a tall post put the sign on a fence or a wall. Vehicles don't read signs - they are for people.
sva.tooltip.howto.roadSign.0=Crafting table: red dye, iron ingot, stick (top to bottom) - 2 signs. A sign alone in the grid - the next picture.
sva.tooltip.howto.roadSign.1=A "Stop" sign alone in the crafting grid.
sva.tooltip.howto.roadSign.2=A "Speed Limit 30" sign alone in the crafting grid.
sva.tooltip.howto.roadSign.3=A "Speed Limit 60" sign alone in the crafting grid.
sva.tooltip.roadSignArrow.summary=§7A direction sign, facing the one who places it
sva.tooltip.roadSignArrow.details=A post with a plate, one block tall. For a tall post put the sign on a fence or a wall.
sva.tooltip.howto.roadSignArrow.0=Crafting table: lapis lazuli, iron ingot, stick (top to bottom) - 2 signs. A sign alone in the grid - the next picture.
sva.tooltip.howto.roadSignArrow.1=An "Ahead Only" sign alone in the crafting grid.
sva.tooltip.howto.roadSignArrow.2=A "Turn Left" sign alone in the crafting grid.
sva.tooltip.howto.roadSignArrow.3=A "Turn Right" sign alone in the crafting grid.
sva.tooltip.trafficLight.summary=§7Redstone: powered - green, not - red
sva.tooltip.trafficLight.details=Every change goes through amber for 1 second. It glows. The lamps face the one who places it. For a tall post put it on a fence or a wall.
sva.tooltip.howto.trafficLight=Crafting table: iron x4, red, yellow and green dye, glowstone dust, redstone.
sva.tooltip.guardRail.summary=§7Stops vehicles
sva.tooltip.guardRail.details=Laid along your look. A vehicle on wheels, tracks or a hover cushion can't drive or step over it - it runs into it and stops; the hit wears the hull four times less than a wall. For people and mobs it is a fence.
sva.tooltip.howto.guardRail=Crafting table: iron ingots x7 (an H shape) - 8 guard rails.
