sva.tooltip.card.blank=§7Blank - right-click your own vehicle to bind it
sva.tooltip.card.details=A key card gives whoever has it in the inventory rights on its vehicle: drive, passenger, cargo, repair. The owner may do everything. After "Change lock" old cards stop working.
sva.tooltip.howto.card=Right-click your own vehicle with a blank card - the owner's card. Shift+right-click with that card (or the "Access" button on the cargo screen's "Vehicle" tab) - the access screen: players and their rights, the lock mode, "Issue card" (needs a blank card in your inventory), "Transfer" the vehicle to another player. Made on the Engineering Workbench.
