sva.tooltip.charger.sv=§dFast charge built in (x2), SV input without transformers
sva.tooltip.charger.fast=Faster: the "Fast Charge" module x2, the "Boost" mode x3 (the station heats up, helium from the column cools it), several stations on one platform add up, a Silicon Age or IC2 energy storage with its output towards the station charges the vehicle directly, the station supercapacitor adds a burst. Platform: up to %s plates.
sva.tooltip.supercap.summary=§7Buffer §f%s EU§7, gives a vehicle up to §f%s EU/t
sva.tooltip.supercap.details=Goes against a charging station. Fills slowly from the grid - any voltage, at most %s EU/t (~20 min from empty) - and while the station charges a vehicle gives it up to %s EU/t on top of the station rate: 50M EU in 5 s. Never feeds the grid. Comparator: its fill.
sva.tooltip.howto.supercap=Place it against the station (any face) and run a cable to it. Right-click: its screen - charge, input, output. Made on the Engineering Workbench ("Blocks" tab).
