sva.fn.engine.tip=Plane, jet, tiltrotor: the engine off - start it (the battery switch must be on): the starter turns the propeller, it catches after 1.5 s, warms up for 3 s - ready (the jet: 3 s spool-up, ignition, 2 s to idle). Running - stop it. With the engine off, pressing forward starts it by itself.
