sva.tooltip.codeCard.details=A transponder with "Day Key" on takes the code from the card in the pilot's inventory by itself (the DAY KEY lamp). Tomorrow the code changes: yesterday's code is a stranger's to the air defence. The secret is not written on it.
sva.tooltip.howto.codeCard=RMB on the command post with it (the owner or the access list) - prints the day's code; or the "Code card" button in its screen (uses paper). Crafting table: 2 paper + blue dye.
sva.fn.ident=Transponder IDENT
sva.fn.ident.tip=Your blip flashes 18 s on every radar and in the command post - the operator sees who is who. The transponder's mode and code - the "Transponder" row of this menu.
