item.siliconagevehicles.vehicle.liner.name=SA-320 Liner
item.siliconagevehicles.battery.liner.name=Liner Battery
sva.component.for.liner=SA-320 liner
sva.tooltip.details.liner=A regional twin-jet airliner in the spirit of the A320: a crew of two pilots and 8 passengers, a cockpit with six displays, ECAM, an overhead panel and a pedestal - all clickable with the mouse. Hydrogen in three tanks (left / centre / right), two removable batteries, an APU, air-started engines.
sva.tooltip.energy.liner=Hydrogen burn: idle ~120 mB/min for both engines, cruise ~750 mB/min, take-off ~1100 mB/min; the APU 40-65 mB/min from the left tank. A full load (48 000 mB) lasts about an hour of flight.
sva.tooltip.vehicle.gas.liner=Tanks: left 35 %%, centre 30 %%, right 35 %%. The engines take from the centre tank first, the APU only from the left one.
sva.tooltip.limits.liner=Take-off run ~90 blocks on a "Runway" (twice that without one), rotation at 94 km/h, stall below 83 km/h (65 with FULL flaps). A landing with the gear up is a belly landing. Top speed 144 km/h.
sva.tooltip.howto.liner2=Cold cockpit: BAT 1 and 2, APU MASTER and START, APU BLEED, ENG MODE START, ENG 2 and ENG 1 MASTER - or "Quick start" (%9$s). W/S - thrust levers, A/D - turn, Space - pull up, "Descend" (%1$s) - push down, "Gear" (%10$s). Hold "Cockpit cursor" (%11$s) to click the switches with the mouse.
sva.tooltip.howto.liner3=Board and leave through the L1 door (left, near the nose): the first click opens the door, the second boards. Hydrogen - with a cell, a bucket or the "Gas Column"; the second battery goes in with a right-click once the first is in. A 7x7 charging platform is also ground power (EXT PWR).
sva.hud.warn.empty.liner=No hydrogen - the engines stopped
sva.fn.gear=Gear
sva.fn.gear.tip=Liner: the gear lever - up / down (on the ground the gear stays down). The pilots (captain and first officer).
sva.fn.cursor=Cockpit cursor
sva.fn.cursor.tip=Liner: while held, the mouse is free and the view stays still - click the cockpit's switches (LMB - on / up / next, RMB - off / down / back, the wheel - selectors). Under a guard: the first click lifts the guard.
sva.fn.engine.liner=Quick start
sva.fn.engine.liner.tip=Liner: the whole start-up by itself in ~40 s - batteries, APU, bleed, engine 2, then 1 (each step on the ECAM). Again - stop it. Needs hydrogen and charged batteries, on the ground. A server may turn it off (manual only).
